#: ../../source/installation/index.md:1
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/installation/index.md:3
msgid ""
"`cneta` is written in C++ and built with CMake; a few R and Python scripts "
"under `util/` support pre/post-processing but are not required to build the "
"main tools. Everything needed comes from conda environment files in the "
"repository, so the same commands work on macOS, Linux, HPC clusters with "
"conda, and Windows via WSL. See the [Developer docs](../developer-"
"guide/index.md) for the current architecture and what's still planned."
msgstr ""
"`cneta` 用 C++ 编写，用 CMake 构建；`util/` 下有一些 R 和 Python "
"脚本用于前后处理，但构建主程序不需要它们。所需的一切都由仓库中的 conda 环境文件提供，所以同样的命令在 macOS、Linux、有 conda 的"
" HPC 集群以及通过 WSL 的 Windows 上都适用。当前架构和后续计划见[开发者文档](../developer-"
"guide/index.md)。"

