#: ../../source/installation/index.md:105
msgid ""
"`build.sh` detects the active conda environment and takes Boost, GSL, zlib "
"and OpenMP from it, so libraries installed elsewhere (e.g. Homebrew) are not"
" picked up."
msgstr ""
"`build.sh` 会检测当前激活的 conda 环境，并从中使用 Boost、GSL、zlib 和 OpenMP，所以装在别处（例如 "
"Homebrew）的库不会被用到。"

#: ../../source/installation/index.md:109
msgid ""
"`build.sh` configures a CMake build in `code/build/`. The three executables "
"(`cnets`, `cnetml`, `cnetmcmc`) land in `bin/` at the top of the repository,"
" next to the `run-*.sh` driver scripts, which is where the scripts and the "
"test suite look for them. The compiled programs are not tracked by git; the "
"scripts are. Set `CNETA_BIN` if you want the run scripts to use a different "
"build."
msgstr ""
"`build.sh` 在 `code/build/` 中配置 CMake "
"构建。三个可执行文件（`cnets`、`cnetml`、`cnetmcmc`）生成在仓库顶层的 `bin/` 中，和 `run-*.sh` "
"运行脚本放在一起，运行脚本和测试都在这里找程序。编译出的程序不纳入 git 管理，脚本纳入。如果想让运行脚本使用另一份构建，设置 "
"`CNETA_BIN`。"

#: ../../source/installation/index.md:115
msgid ""
"With only `cneta-build` active, the run scripts work with `plot=0` (the "
