#: ../../source/installation/index.md:127
msgid ""
"`cnetml` parallelises its tree search with OpenMP. The configure step "
"reports whether it was found:"
msgstr "`cnetml` 用 OpenMP 并行化树搜索。配置阶段会报告是否找到 OpenMP："

#: ../../source/installation/index.md:134
msgid "or, if it was not:"
msgstr "没找到时显示："

#: ../../source/installation/index.md:140
msgid ""
"Without OpenMP the build still succeeds and runs the same algorithm, just "
"without the speed-up."
msgstr "没有 OpenMP 也能构建成功，运行的算法相同，只是没有加速。"

#: ../../source/installation/index.md:143
msgid ""
"**conda (`cneta-build`):** both environment files include OpenMP (`llvm-"
"openmp`), so nothing extra is needed."
msgstr "**conda（`cneta-build`）：** 两个环境文件都包含 OpenMP（`llvm-openmp`），不需要额外安装。"

#: ../../source/installation/index.md:145
msgid "**HPC without conda:** GCC includes OpenMP."
msgstr "**没有 conda 的 HPC：** GCC 自带 OpenMP。"

#: ../../source/installation/index.md:146
msgid ""
"**Thread count:** OpenMP uses all available cores by default. Set "
"`OMP_NUM_THREADS` to limit it, e.g. `OMP_NUM_THREADS=4 bin/run-cnetml.sh`. "
"Floating-point sums over a varying number of threads are not bit-"
"reproducible, so pin `OMP_NUM_THREADS=1` when you need exactly repeatable "
"scores (the test suite does)."
msgstr ""
"**线程数：** OpenMP 默认使用所有可用核心，可以用 `OMP_NUM_THREADS` 限制，例如 `OMP_NUM_THREADS=4 "
"bin/run-cnetml.sh`。线程数不同时，浮点数求和结果不能逐位重现；需要完全可重复的得分时，请设 "
"`OMP_NUM_THREADS=1`（测试就是这样做的）。"

